2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Knud Jonsson must have been a relatively well-to-do farmer as his widow left quite a respectable estate after her death.  He served as a lagrettesmann in 1685. Far hans kom frå Øvre Bjørheim.  I 1733 selde arvingane hans ein del j
2 CONC ordegods i Øvr e Bjørheim til sonesonen hans, Knut Henrikson Vervik.
