1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Anna Knutsdtr was sued by a nephew nine days after she buried her
2 CONT husband. The nephew claimed that he should have the right to operate
2 CONT the entire Helland farm, not just the half he currently did.  The
2 CONT decision of the Idse skipredeting read "and the farm at Helleland in
2 CONT question that during all times has been two mens' farm, of which Peder
2 CONT during his lifetime had run the half for more than twenty years,
2 CONT undisputedly at any court, accordingly we cannot see that Tomas
2 CONT Larsson, being a son of the brother of the deceased Peder Helland, has
2 CONT any right or admission to the deceased Peder's farm".
2 CONT Anna married Tore Pederson Tjøstheim in 1723 and operated the Helland
2 CONT farm.  Later they moved to Tjøstheim.
