1 NAME Erik Mikalson /Rønneberg/
2 GIVN Erik Mikalson
2 SURN Rønneberg
2 _MARNM Sande
1 NAME Erik Mikalson Sande
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1793
2 PLAC Røyneberg 
2 ADDR
3 CITY Sola
3 STAE Rogaland
3 CTRY Norway
1 BAPM
2 DATE 12 JAN 1794
1 DEAT
2 DATE 3 NOV 1881
