2 CONT ----
2 CONT '''Probate record (20-07-1716; Ellen was still alive, but surrendered the estate to her 8 children: Rasmus Mauritsen; Kolben Mauritsen; Mikkel Mauritsen; Torger Mauritsen; Maurits Mauritsen; Anne Mauritsdatter married to Lars Lars
2 CONC en Maudal; Tora Mauritsdatter, married to Tollef Omundsen Tveiten; and Guri Mauritsdatter, married to Torkel Omundsen Bjørnestad):'''
2 CONT Jæren og Dalane sorenskriveri, SAST/A-100306/5, 1714-1722, s. 151. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/sk20110328660151
