1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Høyland Gards- og ættesoge page 160 Gramstad (24. B. d), page 91 Austrått (76. A).
2 CONT
2 CONT To America 1883.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/86116168/gabriel-eliasen-ostroot
2 CONT
2 CONT Gabriel Eliasen was the son of
2 CONT Elias Eliasen Gramstad and Guri Gabrielsdatter.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was born in former Høyland kommune, today part of Sandnes kommune,
2 CONT a neighboring kommune to Stavanger.
2 CONT
2 CONT Gabriel Eliasen Østraadt married Christine Jonasdatter on Sep. 14, 1852.
2 CONT
2 CONT Family in the 1865 census at Østraadt øvre in Høyland(Sandnes):
2 CONT Gabriel Eliasen Husfader g Husmand med Jord 1828 Høilands Pr
2 CONT Christine Jonasdatter hans Kone g 1827 Høilands Pr
2 CONT ..Jonas Gabrielsen deres Søn ug 1853 Høilands Pr
2 CONT ..Elen Marie Gabrielsd.* deres Datter ug 1857 Høilands Pr
2 CONT ..Grethe Bergitte Gabrielsd.* deres Datter ug 1860 Høilands Pr
2 CONT ..Gabriel Gabrielsen deres Søn ug 1862 Høilands Pr
2 CONT ..Kirsten Christine Gabrielsd.* deres Søn ug 1865 Høilands Pr
2 CONT In addition from 1875 census:
2 CONT Gabriel Gabrielsen b.1868 and Eneval Gabrielsen b.1871.
2 CONT
2 CONT (Contributor: Torkel(48106268) - 17Oct2021)
