2 CONT
2 CONT Bertha Aslaksdatter Lura BIRTH	8 Jul 1823 Norway DEATH	16 Dec 1906 (aged 83) Story County, Iowa, USA BURIAL	 Roland Cemetery Howard Township, Story County, Iowa, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT Obituary transcribed by Dorian Myhre, source: The Roland Record, Roland, Story County, Iowa, December 20, 1906
2 CONT
2 CONT "AGED LADY PASSED AWAY.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mrs. Bertha A. Lura was born near Stavanger, Norway July 8, 1823 and died Sunday, December 16, 1906 being the time of her death, 68 years, 5 months and 8 days old. She was married to Mr. Hover Lura in 1846 to which union nine chil
2 CONC dren were born, five of whom survive their mother. They are, Hover Lura, and A. H. Lura of this place, Mrs. M. Malmin, at McCallsburg, Mrs. John Evenson, of this place and Bergitha Lura, of Minneapolis, Minn. All the children were
2 CONC  present at her death.
2 CONT
2 CONT She had 20 grandchildren and 5 great grandchildren. Her husband died in Norway in 1869 and in 1881 she came to this country where she has made her home with her children, having lived at the M. Malmin home the past 13 years.
2 CONT
2 CONT The funeral services were held from the Malmin home at 10:30 a. m. Wednesday and at 1 p. m. at Salem Church in Roland, Rev. Sandven officiating. The remains were interred in the Roland cemetery."
2 CONT
