1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Burial record and obituary:
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/11778825/andrew-knutson
2 CONT
2 CONT Andrew Knutson was born Andreas Knutson on the Meltvedt farm in Strand. He came to America in 1853. His father was Knut Haaversen Meltvedt. His mother was Marthe Sjursdatter Lerang.
2 CONT
2 CONT He settled first in Illinois, but later came to central Iowa. On October 14, 1865, he was married to Anna Cathrine Tjerandsdatter (Cathrine Charlson) in the St. Petri Church in Story City, Iowa. They resided in Scott Township, Ham
2 CONC ilton County.
2 CONT
2 CONT Andrew died on August 15, 1886. There is no record of his death or burial in the St. Petri records. His family had strong Quaker affiliations in Norway as did his brother, Knut, who lived near Estherville, Iowa. Perhaps he had nev
2 CONC er joined the Lutheran Church although his children were all baptized and confirmed there.
2 CONT
2 CONT Andrew and Cathrine were the parents of: Bertha (George Ness), Anna (John Marcus), Taurina (Dan Knutson), Andrine (Osmund Tungesvik), Theodore, Charles (Alta Mills), Lewis (Anna Rasmussen), and Carrie (Walter McGee). 
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: http://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GRid=11778825
